#var, use command >Rest Client: Switch Environment in search bar of vs code
@id=1
@regionalCenterID=1

###

### Get all campuses
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/campuses?page=1&limit=10 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get campus by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/campuses/{{id}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Create a new campus
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/campuses HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "CAMP-003",
  "name": "Campus Principal",
  "description": "Campus principal ubicado en el centro de la ciudad",
  "regionalCenterID": "{{regionalCenterID}}",
  "status": "ACTIVE",
}

###

### Update an existing campus
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/campuses/{{id}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "CAMP-002",
  "name": "Campus Principal Renovado",
  "description": "Campus principal con nuevas instalaciones académicas",
}

###

### Delete a campus
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/campuses/{{id}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
